  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — that the outcome difference is negligible and that the lottery with the higher probability of a favorable outcome should be preferred — is present in the verbal report. The individual acknowledges the 100 euro difference in prize amounts as negligible and explicitly chooses the lottery with the higher probability of winning something (A at 34% vs. B at 33%). The justification aligns directly with the rule of the decision reason: preferring the lottery with the higher probability of a favorable outcome when outcome differences are negligible. Therefore, the individual used the decision reason to make the decision.",
